{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2022-11-29 17:38:00', 'title': 'CINTAS DONATES TOYS, FOOD ITEMS FROM ANNUAL “STUFF THE TRUCK” CAMPAIGN', 'text': "CINCINNATI--( BUSINESS WIRE )--OVER THE LAST MONTH DURING ITS ANNUAL “STUFF THE TRUCK” HOLIDAY DRIVE CAMPAIGN, CINTAS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CTAS) EMPLOYEE-PARTNERS AT THE COMPANY'S MASON-BASED HEADQUARTERS COLLECTED HUNDREDS OF TOYS AND ALMOST 500 POUNDS OF CANNED GOODS, AND NON-PERISHABLE FOOD ITEMS. COLLECTED DONATIONS WERE DELIVERED TODAY TO SHARED HARVEST FOODBANK IN FAIRFIELD, OHIO, AND THE BUTLER/WARREN COUNTIES MARINE CORPS RESERVES TOYS FOR TOTS PROGRAM."}